### SubscriberService API Tests

### Subscribe
POST http://localhost:8088/api/subscribers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "name": "Test User"
}

### Unsubscribe
DELETE http://localhost:8088/api/subscribers/test@example.com

### Get All Subscribers (Active Only)
GET http://localhost:8088/api/subscribers?activeOnly=true

### Get All Subscribers (Including Inactive)
GET http://localhost:8088/api/subscribers?activeOnly=false

### Check Feature Flag Status
GET http://localhost:8088/api/subscribers/feature-flag

### Enable Feature Flag
POST http://localhost:8088/api/subscribers/feature-flag
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true
}

### Disable Feature Flag
POST http://localhost:8088/api/subscribers/feature-flag
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": false
}

